        <Box style={{ width: 432, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6, width: 432 }}>列表与归档范围只决定「看不看得见」，不决定状态。</Text>
